// JSON ingestion mapping for WaterWasteReadings

.create table WaterWasteReadings ingestion json mapping 'WaterWasteReadings_mapping'
```
[
    {"column": "dma_id",                  "path": "$.dma_id",                  "datatype": "string"},
    {"column": "dma_name",                "path": "$.dma_name",                "datatype": "string"},
    {"column": "connections",             "path": "$.connections",             "datatype": "int"},
